#: admin.py:85
msgid "Legal identity"
msgstr "Identidad legal"

#: admin.py:89
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Dirección"

#: admin.py:92
msgid "VAT and currency"
msgstr "IVA y moneda"

#: admin.py:93
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Contacto"

#: admin.py:95
msgid "History"
msgstr "Historial"

#: admin.py:111
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Reglas"

#: admin.py:140
msgid "Rate"
msgstr "Tipo"

#: admin.py:144
msgid ""
"Untick «Subject to VAT» for a territory outside the scope of the tax (Canary "
"Islands, Ceuta, Melilla, third countries). It is not a 0 % rate: the AEAT "
"gets it as a sale not subject to VAT."
msgstr ""
"Desmarca «Sujeto a IVA» en un territorio fuera del ámbito del impuesto "
"(Canarias, Ceuta, Melilla, terceros países). No es un tipo del 0 %: a la "
"AEAT le llega como operación no sujeta."

#: admin.py:150
msgid "Validity"
msgstr "Vigencia"

#: admin.py:153
msgid "Applies"
msgstr "Se aplica"

#: admin.py:156 models.py:694
msgid "Not subject"
msgstr "No sujeta"

#: admin.py:167
msgid "Issuer"
msgstr "Emisor"

#: admin.py:169
msgid "Intra-EU B2B (ROI / VIES)"
msgstr "B2B intracomunitario (ROI / VIES)"

#: admin.py:173
msgid ""
"While unticked, Spanish VAT is charged to EVERY customer, EU businesses "
"included. Even when ticked, each sale also needs a current VIES verdict on "
"the customer's VAT number (see «VAT checks»); otherwise VAT is charged "
"anyway."
msgstr ""
"Mientras esté desmarcado, se cobra IVA español a TODOS los clientes, "
"empresas de la UE incluidas. Aun marcado, cada venta necesita además un "
"veredicto vigente de VIES sobre el NIF-IVA del cliente (ver «Comprobaciones "
"de NIF-IVA»); si no, se cobra el IVA igualmente."

#: admin.py:180
msgid "One-Stop Shop (OSS)"
msgstr "Ventanilla única (OSS)"

#: admin.py:184
msgid ""
"Below the threshold the issuer's country VAT is charged. Above it —or with "
"the OSS registration ticked, which binds for two years— the customer's "
"country rate applies."
msgstr ""
"Por debajo del umbral se cobra el IVA del país del emisor. Por encima —o con "
"el alta en la OSS marcada, que vincula dos años— se aplica el tipo del país "
"del cliente."

#: admin.py:190
msgid "Carried from the old SaaS"
msgstr "Traído del SaaS antiguo"

#: admin.py:194
msgid ""
"Until the invoices live here, the cross-border B2C sales of the year come "
"from the old SaaS: type them for the current year and the year before. "
"Without them the total is unknown and the threshold could be crossed without "
"anybody noticing."
msgstr ""
"Hasta que las facturas vivan aquí, las ventas B2C transfronterizas del año "
"vienen del SaaS antiguo: escríbelas para el año en curso y el anterior. Sin "
"ellas el total es desconocido y el umbral se podría cruzar sin que nadie lo "
"note."

#: admin.py:202
msgid "Cross-border B2C this year"
msgstr "B2C transfronterizo este año"

#: admin.py:206
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Unknown: carry this year's amounts from the old SaaS below (threshold "
"%(threshold)s €)"
msgstr ""
"Desconocido: trae abajo los importes de este año del SaaS antiguo (umbral "
"%(threshold)s €)"

#: admin.py:211
msgid "destination rate"
msgstr "tipo de destino"

#: admin.py:213
msgid "issuer rate"
msgstr "tipo del emisor"

#: admin.py:249
msgid "Current"
msgstr "Vigente"

#: admin.py:277 tests/test_vat_check_api.py:564
msgid "Check now in VIES"
msgstr "Comprobar ahora en VIES"

#: admin.py:290
#, python-format
msgid "%(vat)s: a UK number is HMRC's, not VIES': nothing was asked."
msgstr ""
"%(vat)s: un número británico es de HMRC, no de VIES: no se ha consultado "
"nada."

#: admin.py:300
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Too many VAT checks in the last minute. Not checked, try again shortly: "
"%(numbers)s"
msgstr ""
"Demasiadas comprobaciones de NIF-IVA en el último minuto. Sin comprobar, "
"inténtalo en un momento: %(numbers)s"

#: admin.py:309
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(vat)s: the answer could not be saved, so it proves nothing. Try again."
msgstr ""
"%(vat)s: la respuesta no se pudo guardar, así que no prueba nada. Inténtalo "
"de nuevo."

#: admin.py:317
#, python-format
msgid "%(vat)s: confirmed in VIES (consultation %(consultation)s)."
msgstr "%(vat)s: confirmado en VIES (consulta %(consultation)s)."

#: admin.py:326
#, python-format
msgid "%(vat)s: not registered in VIES. VAT is charged."
msgstr "%(vat)s: no está registrado en VIES. Se cobra el IVA."

#: admin.py:333
#, python-format
msgid "%(vat)s: VIES could not answer. VAT is still charged; try again later."
msgstr ""
"%(vat)s: VIES no ha podido responder. Se sigue cobrando el IVA; inténtalo "
"más tarde."

#: admin.py:351
#, python-format
msgid ""
"VAT number %(vat)s marked as valid BY HAND. Who did it and why is on the "
"record: it is the only way to invoice without VAT when VIES does not confirm "
"the number."
msgstr ""
"NIF-IVA %(vat)s marcado como válido A MANO. Queda constancia de quién y por "
"qué: es la única forma de facturar sin IVA cuando VIES no confirma el número."

#: admin.py:413
msgid "accumulated"
msgstr "acumulado"

#: admin.py:417
msgid "threshold"
msgstr "umbral"

#: admin.py:451
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: admin.py:455
msgid "Not issued yet: its PDF is ready once the platform hub issues it."
msgstr ""
"Aún no se ha emitido: su PDF estará listo cuando la emita el hub de "
"plataforma."

#: admin.py:457
msgid "Download the PDF"
msgstr "Descargar el PDF"

#: admin.py
msgid "Download the PDFs (ZIP)"
msgstr "Descargar los PDF (ZIP)"

#: admin.py
#, python-format
msgid "None of the selected invoices has its PDF yet: %(invoices)s"
msgstr "Ninguna de las facturas elegidas tiene aún su PDF: %(invoices)s"

#: admin.py
msgid "These invoices were left out of the ZIP:"
msgstr "Estas facturas se han quedado fuera del ZIP:"

#: admin.py
#, python-format
msgid "These invoices were left out of the ZIP: %(invoices)s"
msgstr "Estas facturas se han quedado fuera del ZIP: %(invoices)s"

#: admin.py:482 queries.py:1016
msgid "Total"
msgstr "Total"

#: admin.py:491
msgid "Send again to the platform hub"
msgstr "Reenviar al hub de plataforma"

#: admin.py:502
#, python-format
msgid "%(invoice)s: the platform hub says «%(status)s»."
msgstr "%(invoice)s: el hub de plataforma dice «%(status)s»."

#: admin.py:506
#, python-format
msgid "%(invoice)s: not paid, so there is nothing to issue."
msgstr "%(invoice)s: no está pagada, así que no hay nada que emitir."

#: admin.py:510
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(invoice)s: the platform hub refused it (%(code)s). It stays «issuing»."
msgstr ""
"%(invoice)s: el hub de plataforma la rechazó (%(code)s). Sigue «emitiéndose»."

#: admin.py:516
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(invoice)s: the platform hub did not answer. It stays «issuing» and is "
"retried."
msgstr ""
"%(invoice)s: el hub de plataforma no respondió. Sigue «emitiéndose» y se "
"reintentará."

#: admin.py:520
msgid "Send the invoice mail again"
msgstr "Reenviar el correo de la factura"

#: admin.py:527
#, python-format
msgid "%(invoice)s: not issued yet, so it has no mail."
msgstr "%(invoice)s: aún no está emitida, así que no tiene correo."

#: admin.py:531
#, python-format
msgid "%(invoice)s: the mail was sent."
msgstr "%(invoice)s: el correo se envió."

#: admin.py:533
#, python-format
msgid "%(invoice)s: it has nobody to send it to."
msgstr "%(invoice)s: no tiene a quién enviarlo."

#: admin.py:535
#, python-format
msgid "%(invoice)s: the mail could not leave; it is sent again later."
msgstr "%(invoice)s: el correo no pudo salir; se volverá a enviar más tarde."

#: apps.py:18
msgid "Billing"
msgstr "Facturación"

#: emails.py:51
#, python-format
msgid "Credit note %(number)s from ERPlora"
msgstr "Factura rectificativa %(number)s de ERPlora"

#: emails.py:54
#, python-format
msgid "ERPlora issued credit note %(number)s for %(business)s."
msgstr ""
"ERPlora ha emitido la factura rectificativa %(number)s de %(business)s."

#: emails.py:56
#, python-format
msgid "Invoice %(number)s from ERPlora"
msgstr "Factura %(number)s de ERPlora"

#: emails.py:57
#, python-format
msgid "ERPlora issued invoice %(number)s for %(business)s."
msgstr "ERPlora ha emitido la factura %(number)s de %(business)s."

#: emails.py:61
#, python-format
msgid "Date: %(date)s"
msgstr "Fecha: %(date)s"

#: emails.py:63
#, python-format
msgid "Tax base: %(amount)s"
msgstr "Base imponible: %(amount)s"

#: emails.py:64
#, python-format
msgid "VAT (%(rate)s %%): %(amount)s"
msgstr "IVA (%(rate)s %%): %(amount)s"

#: emails.py:69
#, python-format
msgid "Total: %(amount)s"
msgstr "Total: %(amount)s"

#: emails.py:71
#, python-format
msgid "Download it from Billing: %(url)s"
msgstr "Descárgala en Facturación: %(url)s"

#: emails.py:106
#, python-format
msgid "We could not charge the plan of %(business)s"
msgstr "No hemos podido cobrar el plan de %(business)s"

#: emails.py:108
#, python-format
msgid "We could not charge %(amount)s for the plan of %(business)s."
msgstr "No hemos podido cobrar %(amount)s del plan de %(business)s."

#: emails.py:114
msgid ""
"The bank declined your card, so we will not try it again: change the card, "
"then pay the invoice yourself."
msgstr ""
"El banco rechazó tu tarjeta, así que no volveremos a intentar el cobro con "
"ella: cámbiala y paga tú la factura."

#: emails.py:119
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(business)s keeps working until %(date)s. If the invoice is not paid by "
"then, it is suspended. Nothing is deleted."
msgstr ""
"%(business)s sigue funcionando hasta el %(date)s. Si la factura no se paga "
"antes, se suspende. No se borra nada."

#: emails.py:122 emails.py:138
#, python-format
msgid "Pay it from Billing: %(url)s"
msgstr "Págala en Facturación: %(url)s"

#: emails.py:132
#, python-format
msgid "%(business)s is suspended"
msgstr "%(business)s está suspendido"

#: emails.py:134
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(business)s is suspended because an invoice of %(amount)s was not paid."
msgstr ""
"%(business)s está suspendido porque una factura de %(amount)s no se ha "
"pagado."

#: emails.py:136
msgid ""
"Your data is safe: as soon as the invoice is paid, the business works again."
msgstr ""
"Tus datos están a salvo: en cuanto se pague la factura, el negocio vuelve a "
"funcionar."

#: emails.py:153
#, python-format
msgid "Your payment for %(business)s was refunded"
msgstr "Te hemos devuelto el pago de %(business)s"

#: emails.py:156
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You paid for %(business)s after it was handed over to another account. As "
"you no longer own it, the payment was not applied: we cancelled that plan "
"and refunded the %(amount)s in full."
msgstr ""
"Pagaste %(business)s cuando ya se había traspasado a otra cuenta. Como ya no "
"es tuyo, el pago no se ha aplicado: hemos cancelado ese plan y te hemos "
"devuelto los %(amount)s enteros."

#: emails.py:160
msgid "The refund reaches your card within 5 to 10 days."
msgstr "La devolución llega a tu tarjeta en un plazo de 5 a 10 días."

#: emails.py:162
#, python-format
msgid "Its rectifying invoice is in Billing: %(url)s"
msgstr "Tienes su factura rectificativa en Facturación: %(url)s"

#: emails.py:165
#, python-format
msgid "Your plan for %(business)s was cancelled"
msgstr "Hemos cancelado tu plan de %(business)s"

#: emails.py:168
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You confirmed a plan for %(business)s after it was handed over to another "
"account. As you no longer own it, it was not applied: we cancelled it and "
"nothing was charged."
msgstr ""
"Confirmaste un plan para %(business)s cuando ya se había traspasado a otra "
"cuenta. Como ya no es tuyo, no se ha aplicado: lo hemos cancelado y no se ha "
"cobrado nada."

#: emails.py:173
#, python-format
msgid "See it in Billing: %(url)s"
msgstr "Míralo en Facturación: %(url)s"

#: emails.py:199
#, python-format
msgid ""
"OSS: cross-border B2C sales passed %(percent)s %% of the threshold in "
"%(year)s"
msgstr ""
"OSS: las ventas B2C a otros países de la UE pasan del %(percent)s %% del "
"umbral en %(year)s"

#: emails.py:202
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sales to consumers in other EU member states in %(year)s reached %(amount)s "
"(tax base), past %(percent)s %% of the OSS threshold of %(threshold)s."
msgstr ""
"Las ventas a consumidores de otros estados de la UE en %(year)s llegan a "
"%(amount)s (base imponible), más del %(percent)s %% del umbral de la OSS de "
"%(threshold)s."

#: emails.py:206
#, python-format
msgid "Sale that passed it: invoice %(invoice)s."
msgstr "Venta que lo pasó: factura %(invoice)s."

#: emails.py:209
msgid ""
"Above the threshold, destination VAT applies on its own from the crossing "
"sale. Registering in the OSS (form 035) takes days: start it now."
msgstr ""
"Por encima del umbral, el IVA de destino se aplica solo desde la venta que "
"lo cruza. El alta en la OSS (modelo 035) tarda días: empiézala ya."

#: emails.py:214
#, python-format
msgid "OSS: cross-border B2C sales crossed the threshold in %(year)s"
msgstr ""
"OSS: las ventas B2C a otros países de la UE cruzan el umbral en %(year)s"

#: emails.py:217
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sales to consumers in other EU member states in %(last_year)s closed at "
"%(amount)s (tax base), above the OSS threshold of %(threshold)s, so the "
"whole of %(year)s goes in destination VAT."
msgstr ""
"Las ventas a consumidores de otros estados de la UE en %(last_year)s "
"cerraron en %(amount)s (base imponible), por encima del umbral de la OSS de "
"%(threshold)s, así que todo %(year)s va con el IVA de destino."

#: emails.py:222
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sales to consumers in other EU member states in %(year)s reached %(amount)s "
"(tax base), above the OSS threshold of %(threshold)s."
msgstr ""
"Las ventas a consumidores de otros estados de la UE en %(year)s llegan a "
"%(amount)s (base imponible), por encima del umbral de la OSS de "
"%(threshold)s."

#: emails.py:227
#, python-format
msgid "First sale in destination VAT: invoice %(invoice)s, from %(date)s."
msgstr ""
"Primera venta con el IVA de destino: factura %(invoice)s, desde el %(date)s."

#: emails.py:230
msgid ""
"Destination VAT already applies on its own. Registering in the OSS (form "
"035) is urgent: do it now."
msgstr ""
"El IVA de destino ya se aplica solo. El alta en la OSS (modelo 035) es "
"urgente: hazla ya."

#: emails.py:232
msgid "This notice is sent once per year."
msgstr "Este aviso se envía una vez al año."

#: models.py:34
msgid "Two capital letters (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2), e.g. ES."
msgstr "Dos letras mayúsculas (ISO 3166-1 alfa-2), p. ej. ES."

