#: services.py:1241
msgid "Test clocks only exist with Stripe's test keys."
msgstr "Los relojes de prueba solo existen con las claves de prueba de Stripe."

#: services.py:1251
msgid "This business has no payer yet: fill in its billing details first."
msgstr ""
"Este negocio aún no tiene quien lo pague: rellena antes sus datos de "
"facturación."

#: services.py:1255
msgid "Its payer is a Stripe customer already: a clock only takes a new one."
msgstr ""
"Su pagador ya es cliente de Stripe: un reloj solo se ata a un cliente nuevo."

#: services.py:1259 services.py:1284
#, python-format
msgid "Stripe did not take it: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Stripe no lo ha aceptado: %(reason)s"

#: services.py:1271 services.py:1277
msgid "This business has no test clock: attach one first."
msgstr "Este negocio no tiene reloj de prueba: átalo antes a uno."

#: services.py:1280
msgid "Its clock is still advancing: try again in a minute."
msgstr "Su reloj aún está avanzando: inténtalo de nuevo en un minuto."

#: services.py:1522
msgid ""
"This business has as many modules as one subscription can bill. Contact "
"support."
msgstr ""
"Este negocio ya tiene tantos módulos como una suscripción puede cobrar. "
"Contacta con soporte."

#: services.py:1551
msgid ""
"The plan changes at the end of this period: keep the current plan first, "
"then change the modules."
msgstr ""
"El plan cambia al final de este periodo: mantén primero el plan actual y "
"después cambia los módulos."

#: services.py:1667
msgid "This business is already on this plan."
msgstr "Este negocio ya tiene este plan."

#: services.py:1671
msgid "The plan is cancelled: keep it first, then change it."
msgstr "El plan está cancelado: mantenlo primero y después cámbialo."

#: services.py:1810
msgid "The price shown is out of date: review it again."
msgstr "El precio mostrado ya no vale: vuelve a revisarlo."

#: services.py:1817
msgid "This business does not pay anything yet: buy it with the checkout."
msgstr "Este negocio aún no paga nada: cómpralo con el pago."

#: services.py:1941
msgid "This business is on Free: there is nothing to cancel."
msgstr "Este negocio está en Gratis: no hay nada que cancelar."

#: services.py:1970
msgid "This business is on Free: there is nothing to keep."
msgstr "Este negocio está en Gratis: no hay nada que mantener."

#: services.py:2030
msgid ""
"This business's plan is already paid with your card, or it is on Free: there "
"is nothing to keep."
msgstr ""
"El plan de este negocio ya se paga con tu tarjeta, o está en Gratis: no hay "
"nada que mantener."

#: services.py:2076
msgid ""
"This business pays something we no longer sell: contact support to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Este negocio paga algo que ya no vendemos: contacta con soporte para "
"mantenerlo."

#: services.py:2187
msgid "This business has no such module."
msgstr "Este negocio no tiene ese módulo."

#: services.py:2190
msgid "This module comes with the plan: change the plan to drop it."
msgstr "Este módulo viene con el plan: cambia el plan para quitarlo."

#: services.py:2253
msgid "This module has ended: buy it again in the store."
msgstr "Este módulo ha terminado: vuelve a comprarlo en la tienda."

#: services.py:2259
msgid ""
"This module is no longer sold: it works until its cancellation ends and "
"cannot be kept."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo ya no se vende: funciona hasta que termina su cancelación y no "
"se puede mantener."

#: services.py:2271
msgid "The plan is cancelled, and its modules with it: keep the plan first."
msgstr "El plan está cancelado, y sus módulos con él: mantén el plan primero."

#: services.py:2321
msgid ""
"The payment service did not confirm the change. Nothing was charged; try "
"again."
msgstr ""
"El servicio de pagos no ha confirmado el cambio. No se ha cobrado nada; "
"inténtalo de nuevo."

#: services.py:2350
msgid "Payment details cannot be managed right now. Try again later."
msgstr ""
"Los datos de pago no se pueden gestionar ahora mismo. Inténtalo más tarde."

#: services.py:2357
msgid "The payment details appear here after the first payment."
msgstr "Los datos de pago aparecen aquí después del primer pago."

#: services.py:4122 services.py:4143
msgid "Subscription"
msgstr "Suscripción"

#: services.py:4369
msgid "Credit"
msgstr "Abono"

#: services.py:4641
msgid "Refund"
msgstr "Devolución"

#: services.py:4982
msgid "This invoice is paid already."
msgstr "Esta factura ya está pagada."

#: services.py:4984
msgid "This invoice was cancelled: there is nothing to pay."
msgstr "Esta factura se anuló: no hay nada que pagar."

#: services.py:4987
msgid "Only the account that pays this business can pay its invoices."
msgstr "Solo la cuenta que paga este negocio puede pagar sus facturas."

#: services.py:4991
msgid ""
"The bank declined the card. Change the card first, then pay the invoice."
msgstr ""
"El banco rechazó la tarjeta. Cámbiala primero y después paga la factura."

#: emails.py
#, python-format
msgid "Stripe voided the credit note of rectifying invoice %(number)s"
msgstr "Stripe ha anulado la nota de crédito de la factura rectificativa %(number)s"

#: emails.py
#, python-format
msgid "Stripe voided credit note %(credit_note)s, which is rectifying invoice %(number)s."
msgstr "Stripe ha anulado la nota de crédito %(credit_note)s, que es la factura rectificativa %(number)s."

#: emails.py
msgid ""
"Nothing was changed: an invoice sent to the AEAT is never modified. If the money was not given back, issue "
"the invoice that cancels it by hand."
msgstr ""
"No se ha cambiado nada: una factura enviada a la AEAT nunca se modifica. Si el dinero no se devolvió, emite "
"a mano la factura que la anula."
